{"id":3434,"name":"Shiroi Suna no Aquatope","slug":"shiroi_suna_no_aquatope","synopsis":"The anime takes place at Gama Gama Aquarium, a small aquarium in Okinawa, an hour's bus ride from Naha. Kukuru Misakino is an 18-year-old high school student who works there, and she knows about the \"secret\" of the aquarium: sometimes you can see mysterious things. One day Kukuru meets Fuuka, standing in front of a water tank with flowing hair and a tear rolling down her cheek. Fuuka has given up on her dream of becoming an idol and she has run away from Tokyo to Okinawa. Wanting to find a place to belong, Fuuka earnestly asks to work at the aquarium. The anime follows Kukuru and Fuuka as they deal with the issues of the secret of the aquarium and a looming crisis of its possible closure.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)","format":"TV","season":"SUMMER","year":2021,"createdAt":"2021-07-29 08:09:03","updatedAt":"2021-07-29 09:05:07","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":46093},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":128545},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":15987},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":44116},{"site":"ANN","externalId":23923},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":16206},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":7678,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/dOTyVi6radJxhWQq9D1AzBq8sOEe3q8IpTFwiuGz.png"},{"id":7679,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/jERJBnHNVLnoJx0d58IVOnKNiuOL3I4FepO9q5Vq.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":18,"name":"P.A. Works","slug":"pa_works"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":10500,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":1,"song":{"id":10501,"title":"Tayutae, Nanairo","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":12263,"version":1,"episodes":"1-2, 4-12, 24","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":14069,"basename":"ShiroiSunaNoAquatope-OP1.webm","filename":"ShiroiSunaNoAquatope-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/S